    <h1>404 — The page cannot be found</h1>
    <p>The page you requested does not exist on this server. It may have been moved, renamed, or swallowed by a Y2K bug.</p>
    <p>Try one of these instead:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/">The Pants Place 98 desktop</a></li>
      <li><a href="/web/">The PantsNet homepage</a></li>
      <li><a href="/web/news/">Pants News</a></li>
      <li><a href="/web/blog/">The Pants Log</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</WebLayout>
